WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.450
I activate my Continuous Trap Dragonvine!

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.130
Stop it!

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.580
ARC-V has activated!

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.070
The fusion of dimensions will begin now.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:28.740
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:32.410
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.310
Their dragons call to each other,

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.610
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:17.980
The Trembling Dimensions

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.780
We'll reach Yuya and the others very soon.

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:29.450
What?

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:30.860
This is...

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:35.330
Spacetime... The world around us...

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:37.470
Syun, where are you?

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:38.800
Answer me!

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:44.880
What's going on here?

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.850
ARC-V activation confirmed.

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:51.820
Evidence of it affecting Fusion Dimension, too.

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:54.050
Well done.

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:59.950
Soon, ARC-V will expand, taking in 
the Fusion, Synchro, Xyz,

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:03.800
and Standard Dimensions.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:08.080
These four dimensions will merge in ARC-V,

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:11.160
and it will be reborn as the original dimension.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:12.300
And then...

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:19.220
And then Ray... my daughter, 
who was split into four girls,

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:21.980
will be reborn as one person, once more!

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:28.450
Until that happens, I must prevent their union.

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:33.750
Until Ray can be reborn, and I can 
get those four cards in hand...

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.130
Prepare for isolation dome activation.

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:37.930
Yes, sir.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:43.290
Warping in the dimensional fabric...

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.660
ARC-V is activating.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.720
The dimensional fusion is beginning!

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:53.710
Your last hope, Dark Rebellion, is on my side.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:57.080
I cannot imagine you have any remaining options.

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:59.210
Why not just surrender?

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:02.120
No... I...

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.020
I must...

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:13.080
Stop it!

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:17.240
If you want it to stop, just surrender already.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:20.780
And then, become mine...

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:25.040
Go on, say it! Say, "I lose."

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:27.310
Say, "I'll become one with you!"

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:31.150
No... I... I...

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:34.080
Now we'll become one.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:36.890
Now we'll become one.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.560
Now we'll become one!

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:44.240
Now we'll become one. 
Now we'll become one.

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:46.350
Now we'll become one.

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:48.870
Now we'll become one!

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.540
Now... we'll...

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:52.640
Yuya!

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:56.830
Yes, Yuya...

00:04:56.830 --> 00:05:00.440
That's right. You don't want
 them to interrupt us, do you?

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:04.080
Because this is purely between us!

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.600
Do not lose yourself, Yuya!

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:09.770
Your father... Yusyo Sakaki...

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:12.440
He saw his final duel through till the end!

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.430
Dad...

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:16.920
That's right!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:20.770
Do not waste your father's last wish!

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.790
Smiles, Yuya.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:29.600
Dad...

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.680
None of it matters.

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:34.270
Your father does not matter.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:37.920
You should simply be true to your heart.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:40.290
True?

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:41.680
Indeed.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:45.930
What you really want is to 
become one with me.

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:48.720
Be honest about that...

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:52.760
Come on, come to me! Everyone's waiting.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:55.730
Now we'll become one.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.700
Now we'll become one.

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:01.940
Now we'll become one!

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.110
I...

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:06.580
Stop it, Yuya! Don't go!

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:07.810
I...

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:08.780
Stop!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:13.450
I set one card and end my turn!

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:15.190
Yuya...

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:20.290
In that instant, Continuous Trap 
Starlight Force is destroyed.

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:24.490
Clear Wing and Starving Venom's 
levels return to normal,

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:26.770
and they regain their monster effects.

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:31.520
Setting a card means you intend 
to keep going, yes?

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:32.740
Are you sure about this?

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:34.520
I'm sure...

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:37.710
I won't give up until the end!

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.080
Oh, really?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:40.960
You leave me no choice, then.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:45.040
I thought I might let you off easy,

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:47.950
but if that isn't what you want...

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:51.240
I will have to give you a thorough crushing!

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:52.420
My turn!

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:59.100
Starving Venom Fusion Dragon attacks 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:15.210
Next, Clear Wing Synchro Dragon attacks directly!

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:18.060
Action Spell Evasion!

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:19.680
I negate the attack!

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:22.120
Not so fast...

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:25.240
Action Spell No Action!

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:29.090
I negate the activation of an 
Action Spell and destroy it!

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.200
Now, there is nothing left to protect you.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.670
Power level at full.

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:38.640
All circuits connected!

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:41.130
System activation confirmed.

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:43.610
Isolation dome ready to go!

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:45.420
Waiting for your order to proceed.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:50.660
Now, go... Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:57.160
Yuya!

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:01.520
Now, almost there...

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:04.600
Very soon, you and I can become one!

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.570
Activate isolation dome!

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:19.680
Where are we?

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:21.690
What is this?

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:23.620
Is that...

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:27.910
Earth?

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:33.210
Until Ray is reborn,

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:36.140
until those four cards are reborn,

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:43.970
I cannot allow Z-ARC's avatars, 
Yuya and Joeri, to enter ARC-V.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:45.440
Yuya!

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:51.510
Yuya, are you all right?

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.100
I can't hear it.

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:55.750
I can't hear Ray's voice anymore!

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:56.480
What?

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:57.900
Yuya!

00:08:57.900 --> 00:08:59.450
What is going on?

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:01.790
What does it mean?

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:04.760
Why has Ray not yet revived?

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:07.800
Any life readings inside the core?

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:09.210
None confirmed.

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:14.650
Hurry... Hurry and be revived, Ray!

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:17.200
Yuya's father...

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:20.170
Joeri even got Yusyo Sakaki...

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:22.370
Yes...

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:24.670
After all, he stood in my way.

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:28.350
And when Yuya wants so badly 
to become one with me!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.550
That...

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:34.020
That isn't what I want!

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:36.490
Yuya...

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:41.960
I... will never become... one with you!

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:46.660
But with one more hit, you will be dead.

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:48.700
Yuya...

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:56.010
Sorry, but this battle is between the two of us.

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:57.680
I will not let you interfere!

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:10.350
I'll finish you off with the monster 
I took from you...

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:14.360
Yes, with Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:21.720
Does Yuya stand any chance of winning?

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:23.740
He still has his set card.

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:28.210
That is the only thing he 
can stake his hopes on!

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:31.480
Dad...

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:32.880
Now, here we go.

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:39.240
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon attacks Yuya directly!

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.640
Action Cards, eh?

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:45.020
Then I'll get one, too!

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.900
I discard one spell card to—

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:56.730
Action Spell Action Crush!

00:10:57.030 --> 00:11:01.500
This turn, the Action Cards 
in both players' hands

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:03.810
are destroyed and cannot be activated.

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:05.280
Yuya, look out!

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:11.620
I send one spell card from my hand...

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:14.020
from my hand to my graveyard...

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.490
to activate my trap Break Away!

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:21.480
For this turn, I negate the effects 
of all monsters on the field,

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:23.690
and force an end to the Battle Phase!

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:25.260
You're stubborn.

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:29.400
Well, that just leaves more fun for next time...

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:34.760
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:37.240
Yuya...

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:38.250
Why?

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:41.450
Even though he got out of that desperate situation...

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:43.140
Dad...

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:48.600
Wait...

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:50.350
Wait, Dad!

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.500
Don't go!

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:55.330
Sorry...

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.530
I'm sorry, Dad!

00:11:57.530 --> 00:11:59.370
What's wrong, Yuya?

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:00.730
Why are you crying for your father?

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:06.170
I... until now, because I had Smile World...

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:09.270
because Dad was watching over me...

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:12.710
I could resist the call of that devil!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:16.680
But now, I... I've lost Smile World!

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:19.880
The card I got from my father...

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:24.620
I threw it away!

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:32.510
Where am I going to find Syun now?

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:33.600
Kaito...

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:34.490
Syun!

00:12:34.490 --> 00:12:35.670
Where are our other allies?

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:39.140
Edo went after Joeri with a man called Sora.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:42.110
Yuya... You found Yuya?

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:45.510
Without Smile World...

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:48.850
without Dad watching over me...

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.320
I... I...

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:53.050
You will not become a devil!

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:58.260
Your father, Yusyo Sakaki, saw his 
duel through until the end!

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:01.730
Yuya, you must see your duel through, too!

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:04.700
My... duel?

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:09.970
Yes. Surely, that duel did not 
depend on Smile World, did it?

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:11.900
You have your own form of dueling!

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:15.900
The duel of Pendulum's inventor, Yuya Sakaki!

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:21.520
As long as you can do that, 
you will never become a devil!

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:22.980
Z-ARC will not be revived!

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:27.590
You must defeat Joeri! And save the world!

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:29.420
The world?

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:32.300
Yes, I believe in you!

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:33.200
Same here!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.390
I believe, too.

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:36.730
I believe in you, Yuya!

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:42.370
I... no, we... we entrust the future to you.

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:43.960
Please, Yuya!

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:46.570
Reiji, everyone...

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:51.470
Oh, I am so moved...

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:54.250
What a touching scene of friendship.

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:56.950
Dialogue was a bit clichéd, of course.

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:58.780
But I am glad, though.

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:01.600
Thanks to you, he's up for another round.

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:06.170
Had it ended there, I would 
have been unsatisfied.

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:11.060
I will see my duel through...

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:12.800
Just like Dad did!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.860
Do it, Yuya!

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:16.800
Beat that guy up!

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:20.670
Yuya, for now, focus only on winning!

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:22.890
Only on winning...

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:27.010
My... turn!

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:32.950
I'm the inventor of Pendulum Summon.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:36.870
You were born alongside Pendulum.

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.360
I believe in you!

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:42.030
I use the Pendulum Scale already set

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:43.590
to Pendulum Summon!

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:49.530
From my hand, Performapal Trap Mimic!

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:52.340
Performapal Flatrat!

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:59.710
And be reborn from my Extra Deck, 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:07.320
Calling out Odd-Eyes again?

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:09.200
You never learn, do you?

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.300
Don't think about anything else.

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:15.730
Just win.

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:19.200
When Trap Mimic is successfully summoned,

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:22.520
I can destroy one Continuous Trap on your field.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:25.770
I destroy Dragonvine!

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:29.580
He got Dark Rebellion back!

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:35.010
Then, Trap Mimic can take the effect of 
the trap it destroyed, and activate it!

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:40.200
I use Trap Mimic's stolen effect

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:42.980
to take control of Clear Wing!

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:46.840
By using its effect, Trap Mimic is moved

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.030
to my Spell and Trap Zone!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.730
He got Hugo's dragon, too!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:54.000
I see it. Yuya's path to victory...

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:55.200
I see it, too!

00:15:55.780 --> 00:16:00.810
Dark Rebellion can halve the attack points 
of a monster of Level 5 or above,

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:04.680
and add them to its own attack points.

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:07.720
And if he uses Dark Rebellion's effect twice...

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:09.010
Yuya will win!

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:10.210
I will not let you!

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:14.160
I activate my trap Predaplant Reborn!

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:17.420
I Special Summon one Predaplant 
from my graveyard!

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:21.390
Return in Defense Position, Stapeliaworm!

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:26.760
Once per turn, when a monster's 
attack points change,

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:31.370
Stapeliaworm can negate the effect, 
and destroy the card that caused it!

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:35.840
If you want to lose Dark Rebellion, 
go ahead and do it!

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:38.310
I activate Flatrat's effect.

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:41.530
When a monster is summoned 
or Special Summoned,

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:44.780
I set its level to that of Flatrat, Level 5!

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:50.420
And then I use one of Dark 
Rebellion's Overlay Units

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:51.990
to activate its effect!

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.520
Treason Discharge!

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:56.730
I activate Stapeliaworm's effect!

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:59.200
I destroy Dark Rebellion!

00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:03.800
In that instant, I activate Clear 
Wing Synchro Dragon's effect!

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:06.800
When a monster, Level 5 or 
above, activates its effect,

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:10.510
I negate that effect and destroy the monster!

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:15.980
And that monster's attack points are 
added to those of Clear Wing!

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:20.510
And the destruction of Stapeliaworm

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.820
lets Dark Rebellion use its effect!

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:26.020
I halve Starving Venom's attack points

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.850
and add them to Dark Rebellion!

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:33.370
Hugo's cheering him on!

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:34.270
Ute, too!

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:37.550
They've come back, with their dragons!

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:39.040
They're with us again!

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:40.500
Go, Yuya!

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:45.280
Now, I use Dark Rebellion's other Overlay Unit!

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:46.980
Treason Discharge!

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:52.490
Yes, he did it!

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:53.420
Now he's won!

00:17:53.850 --> 00:17:55.020
Defeat Joeri!

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:56.680
It isn't over yet!

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:59.490
I activate my trap Ridiculing World!

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:05.020
I increase the attack points of all monsters 
on your side of the field by 100!

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:13.920
Any monster with higher attack points 
now than they originally had

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:16.440
cannot attack on this turn.

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:19.960
Well? Now you are helpless!

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:25.180
When the attack points of a monster 
on the field change,

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:30.650
I can tribute Flatrat to restore one 
monster's attack points to normal.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:32.490
That won't work!

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:35.050
No matter which dragon you choose,

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:38.460
the moment you destroy Starving 
Venom, its effect will activate.

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:41.400
And it will destroy all your dragons

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:45.700
and deal their attack points as 
damage to you, finishing you!

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:49.940
Isn't that only if you still have life remaining?

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:54.080
The one I restore to normal...

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.610
is Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:01.520
Battle!

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:06.390
I attack Starving Venom Fusion Dragon 
with Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:10.490
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:16.590
When Odd-Eyes does battle with 
a monster of Level 5 or above,

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:19.040
it doubles the battle damage!

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:21.180
Reaction Force!

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:27.350
I... I'm losing?

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:37.070
Yuya!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:37.900
Yes!

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:38.690
We won!

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:42.500
Now, all that remains...

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:51.240
I lost. Hard to believe...

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:55.140
But I am glad my first loss could be to you.

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:59.540
You're me, after all.

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:03.850
Take it. This is what you wanted, right?

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:09.320
Now, absorb me at once.

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:11.870
Yuya won't do that.

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.660
He won't become a devil.

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:17.020
Ute and Hugo surely feel the same way.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.920
That's why they helped Yuya in the duel!

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.130
Pull yourself out of the darkness!

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:24.630
Free yourself from Z-ARC's spell!

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:29.370
I won.

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:33.310
Thinking only of winning, I won.

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:35.280
Yuya...

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:39.250
Just as you people wanted!

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:45.420
And I'm going to keep winning.

00:20:45.420 --> 00:20:48.930
Until I destroy everything in the world!

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:21.260
What is that?

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:25.360
Astrograph Sorcerer, who controls spacetime,

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:30.230
use your unfathomable power 
to bring our wishes together!

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:53.460
This...

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:55.420
What's going on?

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:04.070
What's that?

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:05.690
That is...

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:51.070
I am Z-ARC!

00:23:51.650 --> 00:23:54.080
I have been revived!

00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:56.350
Answer me! Where is Yuya?

00:23:56.350 --> 00:23:59.040
Are you using Yuya?

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:01.920
This is who I really am.

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:05.520
Yuya Sakaki was just an avatar 
used to serve my purposes.

00:24:05.520 --> 00:24:08.700
Now, behold my power!

00:24:08.700 --> 00:24:10.780
Know it!

00:24:11.440 --> 00:24:15.100
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Supreme King's Reign!

00:24:15.510 --> 00:24:17.610
The fun is only getting started!
